Class 1 (PPD) conditions mostly involve low support, higher need for support, negative or neutral feelings about motherhood, inability to relax or sleep, larger household size, low or no income, birth complications combined with low support, lower education, village residence with low support, or even happy feelings combined with low support and some need for support.

